## 3. Business Validation Rules (`HotelServiceLayer`)

All reservation creates and updates execute inside a `synchronized(WRITE_LOCK)` block in `HotelServiceLayer.java` to guarantee thread safety:

| Rule | Validation Condition | Error Response |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Stay Duration** | `check_out` must be after `check_in` and within 365 days | `Stay must be between 1 and 365 nights` |
| **Party Capacity** | `party_size` (1–12) cannot exceed `room.capacity` | `Party exceeds room capacity` |
| **Room Availability** | Active bookings require `room.status == "AVAILABLE"` | `Room is under maintenance` |
| **Double-Booking Check** | Rejects overlapping dates (`in < otherOut && out > otherIn`) for `CONFIRMED` or `CHECKED_IN` bookings on the same `room_id` | `Room already reserved for these dates` |
| **Check-In Window** | `CHECKED_IN` status allowed only when `check_in <= today < check_out` | `Check-in is only available during the stay dates` |
| **Check-Out Window** | `CHECKED_OUT` status disallowed before `check_in` | `Cannot check out before arrival` |
| **Quote Preservation** | Updating an existing booking without changing `guest_id`, `room_id`, `check_in`, `check_out`, or `type` preserves the original `total` | Historical rate retained |
| **Safe Deletion** | Bookings in `CONFIRMED` or `CHECKED_IN` status cannot be deleted directly | `Cancel or complete this reservation before deletion` |
| **Review Integrity** | Reservations linked to `VerifiedStayReview` records cannot be deleted or reverted from `CHECKED_OUT` | `This reservation is linked to reviews. Remove linked reviews first.` |

