## 4. REST API Endpoints (`ReservationServlet`)

All endpoints require an active authenticated session (`AuthServlet`), and write requests (`POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE`) require a valid `X-CSRF-Token` header (`ApiServlet`).

### 4.1 List All Reservations (`READ`)
